Single-database configuration for Flask.
# Full Auth Flask Backend - Productivity App

A secure, session-authenticated RESTful Flask API backend designed for productivity tools. This application features user registration, login, active session management, secure password hashing with `Flask-Bcrypt`, database migrations via `Flask-Migrate`, and fully user-owned `Note` resources supporting complete CRUD operations and pagination.

---

## Project Architecture & File Structure

```text
productivity-backend/
├── app.py              # Core Flask application, extension configurations, auth views, and RESTful CRUD resources
├── models.py           # SQLAlchemy User and Note models with built-in bcrypt password hashing
├── seed.py             # Database seeder script utilizing Faker for sample users and notes
├── app.db              # SQLite database (generated and managed via Flask-Migrate)
├── Pipfile             # Dependency tracking and virtual environment specification
└── README.md           # Project documentation and endpoint references